  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Building Collaborative Governance in Times of Uncertainty (2023), published by Leuven University Press, has been cited 12 times \u2014 enough that OpenAlex puts it in the top 1% of works in its field and year. Beyond that, it has been downloaded 2,017 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Building Collaborative Governance in Times of Uncertainty by Geert Bouckaert was published by Leuven University Press in 2023. Conceptually, the work connects to Democracy, Institutionalisation, Corporate governance, Accountability and Public relations.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records 12 citations. That places it in the top 1% of works in its field and year of publication. Citations peaked in 2024 with 6 citing works. Notable citing venues include Development in Practice, International Review of Administrative Sciences and Sustainable Development. The citing works include 10 journal articles and 1 preprint. They come from 10 countries, led by Spain, Belgium and the United Kingdom.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 2,017 times via OAPEN. Its subject matter aligns with Partnerships for the goals among the Sustainable Development Goals. The work was funded by Diputaci\u00f3n Foral de Gipuzkoa.</p>",
  "events": {},
  "scite": {},
